aton or a second Maxwell field is added, and is that bound necessary?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0038"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2b571e439f1cb7212c2719c7d77410f44aa85a9f3a959c6385e5b789f1815629","title":"How can microscopic hard/soft entanglement and string-scale dynamics produce smooth horizon spacetime alongside unitary distant evolution, extend to other horizons, and select observables usable by an internal observer applying the Born rule?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0044"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2b1f451f54a549691bdc034786df5a5183c3c8a13d3c95c687bb99c98377b49f","title":"Can the gravitational replica path integral directly yield a radiation entropy compatible with unitarity and the island rule, without higher-dimensional holographic input?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0048"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2b0c3fcce0f8a1ffeab3f81004ef53cd87f42402972737f5354d90a4fc7d57a2","title":"Do charged open-string scalar modes satisfy the coupling bound independently of their expectation values? Expected nonperturbative towers and geometric uplifts have not been converted into quantitative tests.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0053"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2b4cc96510ffdab1e6f536e38f3f024ee97db49775bb1544b2e5edba36e2faaa","title":"Can duality symmetries inherited from the UV make positivity bounds or the null energy condition sufficient for the mild WGC in Einstein-Maxwell-dilaton-axion theory, and how does additional supersymmetry constrain extremality corrections?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0054"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:2b534c5c748c72829faefceb4c662865dc9a80147f6a5952f8fa74a0d648d80b","title":"Can gauge friction reconcile a 